# Starter files for the Web Design (HTML) course's Grade 11 and 12 lessons
# (AIPascalCourse/content/cathtml/quickstart ... scenario - courses/
# cat-practical-writing.md, "Grades 11 and 12"; Chris, 8 October 2026: "cat
# files also must be stored using the cloud - google drive"). Each .html file
# is the starter of one lesson's html block, the same as
# public/assets/practical/cathtml/<file> on the site (written from the lessons
# by the writer's scratch script; keep the two the same). The pictures the
# pages use (public/assets/practical/html/botha/, drawn for the lessons) are
# carried here as base64, so that the pages show them: next to the pages and
# in an img folder. Saved in C:\sims\files\cathtml-files1112\botha\ (they come
# back to files\cathtml-files1112\) and in G:\My Drive\CAT\HTML\botha\ for the
# pupils' cloud folder. Plain files, no Office; nothing clicks or types.
# Run from the host:  pwsh -File vm-shots.ps1 cathtml-files1112
$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'
